e"],"explanation":"Somewhere joy.","hint":"Someone is … / I didn’t see anyone. / Nobody is …","options":["a safe place","a known person","every object"]}],[{"id":"en-a2-16-exit-b0","type":"order","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Gapni tartiblang.","answers":["Does anyone know the owner?"],"explanation":"Someone/somebody — kimdir; something — nimadir; somewhere — qayerdir. Bu so‘zlar ko‘pincha tasdiqda. Anyone/anything/anywhere savol va inkorda ko‘p uchraydi. Nobody/nothing/nowhere o‘zi inkor, qo‘shimcha not talab qilmaydi. Someone va everyone grammatik birlik: Everyone is here. They ko‘pincha jinsi noma’lum shaxsga keyingi gapda neytral murojaat qiladi.","hint":"Someone is … / I didn’t see anyone. / Nobody is …","tokens":["Does","anyone","know","the","owner?"]},{"id":"en-a2-16-exit-b1","type":"grammarFill","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Everyone ___ here.","answers":["is"],"explanation":"Someone/somebody — kimdir; something — nimadir; somewhere — qayerdir. Bu so‘zlar ko‘pincha tasdiqda. Anyone/anything/anywhere savol va inkorda ko‘p uchraydi. Nobody/nothing/nowhere o‘zi inkor, qo‘shimcha not talab qilmaydi. Someone va everyone grammatik birlik: Everyone is here. They ko‘pincha jinsi noma’lum shaxsga keyingi gapda neytral murojaat qiladi.","hint":"Someone is … / I didn’t see anyone. / Nobody is …"},{"id":"en-a2-16-exit-b2","type":"order","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Gapni tartiblang.","answers":["Nobody is in the room."],"explanation":"Someone/somebody — kimdir; something — nimadir; somewhere — qayerdir. Bu so‘zlar ko‘pincha tasdiqda. Anyone/anything/anywhere savol va inkorda ko‘p uchraydi. Nobody/nothing/nowhere o‘zi inkor, qo‘shimcha not talab qilmaydi. Someone va everyone grammatik birlik: Everyone is here. They ko‘pincha jinsi noma’lum shaxsga keyingi gapda neytral murojaat qiladi.","hint":"Someone is … / I didn’t see anyone. / Nobody is …","tokens":["Nobody","is","in","the","room."]},{"id":"en-a2-16-exit-b3","type":"choice","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Nobody bilan not qo‘shish kerakmi?","answers":["No"],"explanation":"Nobody o‘zi inkor.","hint":"Someone is … / I didn’t see anyone. / Nobody is …","options":["No","Yes","Always"]},{"id":"en-a2-16-exit-b4","type":"order","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Gapni tartiblang.","answers":["We can put it somewhere safe."],"explanation":"Someone/somebody — kimdir; something — nimadir; somewhere — qayerdir. Bu so‘zlar ko‘pincha tasdiqda. Anyone/anything/anywhere savol va inkorda ko‘p uchraydi. Nobody/nothing/nowhere o‘zi inkor, qo‘shimcha not talab qilmaydi. Someone va everyone grammatik birlik: Everyone is here. They ko‘pincha jinsi noma’lum shaxsga keyingi gapda neytral murojaat qiladi.","hint":"Someone is … / I didn’t see anyone. / Nobody is …","tokens":["We","can","put","it","somewhere","safe."]}]],"sources":[{"id":"cefr","name":"Council of Europe — CEFR daraja tavsiflari","levels":["PRE","A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"skill":"framework","url":"https://www.coe.int/en/web/common-european-framework-reference-languages/level-descriptions","task":"Dars maqsadini qila olaman tavsifi bilan solishtiring. PRE — kursning tayyorlov bosqichi.","lesson":"en-a2-16","verified":"2026-10-05","mode":"link","rights":"Manba saytida bajariladi; himoyalangan matn yoki audio ko‘chirilmagan."},{"id":"pronunciation","name":"Cambridge Dictionary — Pronunciation","levels":["PRE","A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"skill":"pronunciation","url":"https://dictionary.cambridge.org/pronunciation/","task":"Darsdan ikki so‘z tanlang, UK/US talaffuzini eshiting va urg‘uni qayd eting.","lesson":"en-a2-16","verified":"2026-10-05","mode":"link","rights":"Manba saytida bajariladi; himoyalangan matn yoki audio ko‘chirilmagan."},{"id":"bc-grammar","name":"British Council — Grammar","levels":["A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"skill":"grammar","url":"https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/free-resources/grammar","task":"Darajangizdagi dars mavzusini toping va bitta o‘xshash misol yozing.","lesson":"en-a2-16","verified":"2026-10-05","mode":"link","rights":"