a2-16","verified":"2026-10-05","mode":"link","rights":"Manba saytida bajariladi; himoyalangan matn yoki audio ko‘chirilmagan."}],"recapEvery":4,"project":false,"rights":"Original SinfQuiz content; local Flite synthetic speech. Educational references are linked, not copied.","recapQuestions":[{"id":"en-a2-16-recap-0","type":"choice","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Takrorlash · Since, for va o‘tgan vaqtni tanlash: Tugallangan vaqt uchun mos gap?","answers":["We met yesterday."],"explanation":"Yesterday bilan Past Simple.","hint":"for two years / since 2024; have lived … / met yesterday","options":["We met yesterday.","We have met yesterday.","We has met yesterday."],"recap":true,"sourceLesson":"Since, for va o‘tgan vaqtni tanlash"},{"id":"en-a2-16-recap-1","type":"choice","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Takrorlash · Zero va First Conditional: Umumiy natijani tanlang.","answers":["If you heat ice, it melts."],"explanation":"Zero conditional umumiy qonuniyat.","hint":"If + present, present / If + present, will + verb","options":["If you heat ice, it melts.","If you heated ice, yesterday.","If ice will melts."],"recap":true,"sourceLesson":"Zero va First Conditional"},{"id":"en-a2-16-recap-2","type":"choice","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Takrorlash · Gerund va infinitive: niyat va yoqtirish: Decide bilan mos qolip?","answers":["decide to join"],"explanation":"Decide to do — qaror.","hint":"enjoy doing / want to do / decide to join","options":["decide to join","decide joining (ordinary intention)","decide joins"],"recap":true,"sourceLesson":"Gerund va infinitive: niyat va yoqtirish"}]}'::jsonb) on conflict(id,revision) do nothing;
insert into public.sq_en_content(id,base_id,owner_id,level,ordinal,status,revision,payload) values('en-a2-17','en-a2-17',null,2,17,'published',1,'{"id":"en-a2-17","baseId":"en-a2-17","revision":1,"level":"A2","levelIndex":2,"order":17,"title":"Yo‘nalishlar va kundalik phrasal verbs","objective":"Turn left, get on/off, pick up bilan yo‘l va vazifani tushuntirasiz.","context":"Yangi sinfdosh kutubxonaga avtobus bilan boradi.","prerequisites":["en-a2-16"],"minutes":40,"skills":["grammar","vocabulary","pronunciation","listening","reading","writing","speaking"],"rules":["Turn left/right, go straight, cross the road yo‘nalish buyruqlaridir. Across bir tomondan ikkinchisiga, along esa yo‘l bo‘ylab.","Get on/off avtobus yoki poyezdga chiqish/tushish. Pick up buyumni olish yoki odamni olib ketish bo‘lishi mumkin. Ma’noni vaziyat beradi.","Pick the book up / pick up the book mumkin, ammo olmosh o‘rtada: pick it up. Get on the bus kabi ajralmaydigan qolip bilan farqlang."],"pattern":"go straight / turn left / get off / pick it up","examples":["Go straight and turn left.","Get on the bus at this stop.","Get off near the library.","Walk across the road carefully.","Please pick it up.","We set off at nine."],"vocabulary":[{"id":"en-a2-17-v0","term":"turn left","meaning":"chapga burilmoq","ipa":"/tɜːn left/","collocation":"turn left at the bank","example":"Go straight and turn left."},{"id":"en-a2-17-v1","term":"get off","meaning":"tushmoq","ipa":"/ɡet ɒf/","collocation":"get off the bus","example":"Get off near the library."},{"id":"en-a2-17-v2","term":"pick up","meaning":"olmoq, olib ketmoq","ipa":"/pɪk ʌp/","collocation":"pick it up","example":"pick it up"},{"id":"en-a2-17-v3","term":"across","meaning":"narigi tomoniga","ipa":"/əˈkrɒs/","collocation":"across the road","example":"Walk across the road carefully."}],"visuals":[{"kind":"map","title":"Ma’no va tuzilish","items":["go straight / turn left / get off / pick it up","Go straight and turn left.","Get on the bus at this stop."]},{"kind":"story","title":"Vaziyatni gapga aylantiring","items":["Yangi sinfdosh kutubxonaga avtobus bilan boradi.","Get off near the library.","Please pick it up."]}],"pronunciation":{"focus":"Gapdagi mazmunli so‘zlarni urg‘u bilan ayting. Nuqtada to‘xtab, yozuvni qayta tinglang.","text":"Walk across the road carefully.","audio":"/english-course/v7.23/en-a2-17-dictation.mp3"},"exercises":[{"id":"en-a2-17-choice","type":"choice","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Avtobusdan tushmoq uchun ibora?","answers":["get off"],"explanation":"Get off transportdan tushish.","hint":"go straight / turn left / get off / pick it up","options":["get off","get on","go up"]},{"id":"en-a2-17-gap","type":"grammarFill","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Please pick ___ up. (it)","answers":["it"],"explanation":"Turn left/right, go straight, cross the road yo‘nalish buyruqlaridir. Across bir tomondan ikkinchisiga, along esa yo‘l bo‘ylab. Get on/off avtobus yoki poyezdga chiqish/tushish. Pick up buyumni olish yoki odamni olib ketish bo‘lishi mumkin. Ma’noni vaziyat beradi. Pick the book up / pick up the book mumkin, ammo olmosh o‘rtada: pick it up. Get on the bus kabi ajralmaydigan qolip bilan farqlang.","hint":"go straight / turn left / get off / pick it up"},{"id":"en-a2-17-order","type":"order","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Kartalarni to‘g‘ri tartibga qo‘ying.","answers":["Go straight and turn left."],"explanation":"Turn left/right, go straight, cross the road yo‘nalish buyruqlaridir. Across bir tomondan ikkinchisiga, along esa yo‘l bo‘ylab. Get on/off avtobus yoki poyezdga chiqish/tushish. Pick up buyumni olish yoki odamni olib ketish bo‘lishi mumkin. Ma’noni vaziyat beradi. Pick the book up / pick up the book mumkin, ammo olmosh o‘rtada: pick it up. Get on the bus kabi ajralmaydigan qolip bilan farqlang.","hint":"go straight / turn left / get off / pick it up","tokens":["Go","straight","and","turn","left."]},{"id":"en-a2-17-fix","type":"correction","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Pick up it.","answers":["Pick it up."],"explanation":"Turn left/right, go straight, cross the road yo‘nalish buyruqlaridir. Across bir tomondan ikkinchisiga, along esa yo‘l bo‘ylab. Get on/off avtobus yoki poyezdga chiqish/tushish. Pick up buyumni olish yoki odamni olib ketish bo‘lishi mumkin. Ma’noni vaziyat beradi. Pick the book up / pick up the book mumkin, ammo olmosh o‘rtada: pick it up. Get on the bus kabi ajralmaydigan qolip bilan farqlang.","hint":"go straight / turn left / get off / pick it up"},{"id":"en-a2-17-vocabulary","type":"matching","skill":"vocabulary","prompt":"So‘zlarni ma’nolari bilan moslang.","answers":["chapga burilmoq","tushmoq","olmoq, olib ketmoq","narigi tomoniga"],"explanation":"So‘zni alohida emas, darsdagi birikma va gap bilan eslang.","hint":"go straight / turn left / get off / pick it up","left":["turn left","get off","pick up","across"],"options":["chapga burilmoq","tushmoq","olmoq, olib ketmoq","narigi tomoniga"]}],"reading":{"title":"Yo‘nalishlar va kundalik phrasal verbs — vaziyat","text":"To reach the library, get on bus 4 at the school stop. Get off at the bank. Walk across the road at the crossing, then go straight for two minutes. Turn left at the bookshop. The library is next to a small park. Lola will pick you up at the library entrance if you cannot find the room. Bring your notebook, and remember to pick it up before you leave. Our group sets off for the museum at nine the next morning.","sentences":["To reach the library, get on bus 4 at the school stop.","Get off at the bank.","Walk across the road at the crossing, then go straight for two minutes.","Turn left at the bookshop.","The library is next to a small park.","Lola will pick you up at the library entrance if you cannot find the room.","Bring your notebook, and remember to pick it up before you leave.","Our group sets off for the museum at nine the next morning."],"questions":[{"id":"en-a2-17-reading0","type":"choice","skill":"reading","prompt":"Qayerda avtobusdan tushiladi?","answers":["at the bank"],"explanation":"Get off at the bank.","hint":"go straight / turn left / get off / pick it up","options":["at the bank","at the school","at the museum"]},{"id":"en-a2-17-reading1","type":"choice","skill":"reading","prompt":"Olmosh bilan mos tartib qaysi?","answers":["pick it up"],"explanation":"Ajraladigan qolipda olmosh o‘rtada.","hint":"go straight / turn left / get off / pick it up","options":["pick it up","pick up it","it pick up"]},{"id":"en-a2-17-evidence","type":"evidence","skill":"reading","prompt":"Vaziyatni tanishtiradigan birinchi jumlani tanlang.","answers":["0"],"explanation":"Birinchi jumla matn vaziyatini tanishtiradi; keyingi jumlalar uni rivojlantiradi.","hint":"go straight / turn left / get off / pick it up","options":["To reach the library, get on bus 4 at the school stop.","Get off at the bank.","Walk across the road at the crossing, then go straight for two minutes.","Turn left at the bookshop.","The library is next to a small park.","Lola will pick you up at the library entrance if you cannot find the room.","Bring your notebook, and remember to pick it up before you leave.","Our group sets off for the museum at nine the next morning."]}]},"listening":{"title":"Suhbatni tushunish","transcript":"Get on bus four at school. Get off at the bank. Cross the road safely and go straight. Turn left at the bookshop. The library is next to the park.","audio":"/english-course/v7.23/en-a2-17.mp3","synthetic":true,"questions":[{"id":"en-a2-17-listening0","type":"choice","skill":"listening","prompt":"Avtobus raqami?","answers":["four"],"explanation":"Bus four.","hint":"go straight / turn left / get off / pick it up","options":["four","two","nine"]},{"id":"en-a2-17-listening1","type":"choice","skill":"listening","prompt":"Qayerda chapga buriladi?","answers":["at the bookshop"],"explanation":"Turn left at the bookshop.","hint":"go straight / turn left / get off / pick it up","options":["at the bookshop","at school","in the park"]},{"id":"en-a2-17-audio-table","type":"table","skill":"listening","prompt":"Tinglangan ma’lumotni jadvalga yozing.","answers":["4","bank"],"explanation":"Jadvaldagi javoblar yozuvda aynan aytilgan. Mavjud bo‘lmagan tafsilotni taxmin qilmang.","hint":"go straight / turn left / get off / pick it up","rows":["Avtobus","Tushish joyi"]},{"id":"en-a2-17-dictation","type":"dictation","skill":"listening","prompt":"Eshitgan gapingizni yozing.","answers":["Walk across the road carefully."],"explanation":"Gapdagi asosiy so‘zlar, yordamchi fe’l va inkor saqlanishi kerak.","hint":"go straight / turn left / get off / pick it up","audio":"/english-course/v7.23/en-a2-17-dictation.mp3","transcript":"Walk across the road carefully."}]},"writing":{"task":"Maktabdan bir manzilgacha xavfsiz yo‘l ko‘rsatmasini yozing.","audience":"Sinfdagi sherigingiz","minWords":55,"maxWords":140,"plan":["Vaziyatni ayting.","Darsdagi til vositasidan foydalaning.","Muhim tafsilot yoki sabab qo‘shing.","O‘qib, ma’no va shaklni tekshiring."],"model":"Get on bus 4 at the school stop and get off at the bank. Cross the road at the crossing. Go straight for two minutes, then turn left at the bookshop. The library is next to the park. I will pick you up at the entrance. Please bring your notebook and pick it up before you leave.","modelNotes":["Birinchi gap maqsadni belgilaydi.","Darsdagi tuzilma vaziyatga xizmat qiladi.","Oxirgi gap fikrni yakunlaydi."],"phrases":["Go straight and turn left.","Get on the bus at this stop.","Get off near the library."],"checklist":["Topshiriq va auditoriyaga mos yozdim.","Fikrni o‘z so‘zlarim bilan ifodaladim.","Darsdagi shaklni to‘g‘ri ishlatdim.","Imlo, bog‘lanish va tinish belgilarini tekshirdim."]},"speaking":{"task":"Xaritada sherigingizni manzilga olib boring; u yo‘lni qayta aytsin.","seconds":50,"prompts":["Asosiy fikringiz nima?","Bitta tafsilot yoki misol qo‘shing.","Sherigingizning savoliga javob bering."],"rubric":["Vazifani bajarish","Til vositalari va aniqlik","Bog‘langan, tushunarli nutq","Talaffuz va muloqot"]},"rubrics":{"writing":["Mazmun va vazifani bajarish","Tuzilish va bog‘lanish","Til vositalari va uslub","Grammatika va imlo"],"speaking":["Vazifa va o‘zaro muloqot","Ravonlik va bog‘lanish","Til vositalari va aniqlik","Tushunarlilik va talaffuz"]},"realTask":"Maktabdan bir manzilgacha xavfsiz yo‘l ko‘rsatmasini yozing.","exit":[[{"id":"en-a2-17-exit0","type":"grammarFill","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Turn ___. (chapga)","answers":["left"],"explanation":"Turn left/right, go straight, cross the road yo‘nalish buyruqlaridir. Across bir tomondan ikkinchisiga, along esa yo‘l bo‘ylab. Get on/off avtobus yoki poyezdga chiqish/tushish. Pick up buyumni olish yoki odamni olib ketish bo‘lishi mumkin. Ma’noni vaziyat beradi. Pick the book up / pick up the book mumkin, ammo olmosh o‘rtada: pick it up. Get on the bus kabi ajralmaydigan qolip bilan farqlang.","hint":"go straight / turn left / get off / pick it up"},{"id":"en-a2-17-exit1","type":"grammarFill","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Get ___ the bus. (tushmoq)","answers":["off"],"explanation":"Turn left/right, go straight, cross the road yo‘nalish buyruqlaridir. Across bir tomondan ikkinchisiga, along esa yo‘l bo‘ylab. Get on/off avtobus yoki poyezdga chiqish/tushish. Pick up buyumni olish yoki odamni olib ketish bo‘lishi mumkin. Ma’noni vaziyat beradi. Pick the book up / pick up the book mumkin, ammo olmosh o‘rtada: pick it up. Get on the bus kabi ajralmaydigan qolip bilan farqlang.","hint":"go straight / turn left / get off / pick it up"},{"id":"en-a2-17-exit2","type":"grammarFill","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Pick ___ up. (it)","answers":["it"],"explanation":"Turn left/right, go straight, cross the road yo‘nalish buyruqlaridir. Across bir tomondan ikkinchisiga, along esa yo‘l bo‘ylab. Get on/off avtobus yoki poyezdga chiqish/tushish. Pick up buyumni olish yoki odamni olib ketish bo‘lishi mumkin. Ma’noni vaziyat beradi. Pick the book up / pick up the book mumkin, ammo olmosh o‘rtada: pick it up. Get on the bus kabi ajralmaydigan qolip bilan farqlang.","hint":"go straight / turn left / get off / pick it up"},{"id":"en-a2-17-exit3","type":"choice","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Roadning narigi tomoniga o‘tish?","answers":["across"],"explanation":"Across — bir tomondan boshqasiga.","hint":"go straight / turn left / get off / pick it up","options":["across","along only","inside"]},{"id":"en-a2-17-exit4","type":"choice","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Boshlash, yo‘lga chiqish iborasi?","answers":["set off"],"explanation":"Set off — yo‘lga chiqmoq.","hint":"go straight / turn left / get off / pick it up","options":["set off","turn off always","pick it"]}],[{"id":"en-a2-17-exit-b0","type":"order","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Gapni tartiblang.","answers":["Get on the bus at this stop."],"explanation":"Turn left/right, go straight, cross the road yo‘nalish buyruqlaridir. Across bir tomondan ikkinchisiga, along esa yo‘l bo‘ylab. Get on/off avtobus yoki poyezdga chiqish/tushish. Pick up buyumni olish yoki odamni olib ketish bo‘lishi mumkin. Ma’noni vaziyat beradi. Pick the book up / pick up the book mumkin, ammo olmosh o‘rtada: pick it up. Get on the bus kabi ajralmaydigan qolip bilan farqlang.","hint":"go straight / turn left / get off / pick it up","tokens":["Get","on","the","bus","at","this","stop."]},{"id":"en-a2-17-exit-b1","type":"grammarFill","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Get ___ the bus. (tushmoq)","answers":["off"],"explanation":"Turn left/right, go straight, cross the road yo‘nalish buyruqlaridir. Across bir tomondan ikkinchisiga, along esa yo‘l bo‘ylab. Get on/off avtobus yoki poyezdga chiqish/tushish. Pick up buyumni olish yoki odamni olib ketish bo‘lishi mumkin. Ma’noni vaziyat beradi. Pick the book up / pick up the book mumkin, ammo olmosh o‘rtada: pick it up. Get on the bus kabi ajralmaydigan qolip bilan farqlang.","hint":"go straight / turn left / get off / pick it up"},{"id":"en-a2-17-exit-b2","type":"order","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Gapni tartiblang.","answers":["Walk across the road carefully."],"explanation":"Turn left/right, go straight, cross the road yo‘nalish buyruqlaridir. Across bir tomondan ikkinchisiga, along esa yo‘l bo‘ylab. Get on/off avtobus yoki poyezdga chiqish/tushish. Pick up buyumni olish yoki odamni olib ketish bo‘lishi mumkin. Ma’noni vaziyat beradi. Pick the book up / pick up the book mumkin, ammo olmosh o‘rtada: pick it up. Get on the bus kabi ajralmaydigan qolip bilan farqlang.","hint":"go straight / turn left / get off / pick it up","tokens":["Walk","across","the","road","carefully."]},{"id":"en-a2-17-exit-b3","type":"choice","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Roadning narigi tomoniga o‘tish?","answers":["across"],"explanation":"Across — bir tomondan boshqasiga.","hint":"go straight / turn left / get off / pick it up","options":["across","along only","inside"]},{"id":"en-a2-17-exit-b4","type":"order","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Gapni tartiblang.","answers":["We set off at nine."],"explanation":"Turn left/right, go straight, cross the road yo‘nalish buyruqlaridir. Across bir tomondan ikkinchisiga, along esa yo‘l bo‘ylab. Get on/off avtobus yoki poyezdga chiqish/tushish. Pick up buyumni olish yoki odamni olib ketish bo‘lishi mumkin. Ma’noni vaziyat beradi. Pick the book up / pick up the book mumkin, ammo olmosh o‘rtada: pick it up. Get on the bus kabi ajralmaydigan qolip bilan farqlang.","hint":"go straight / turn left / get off / pick it up","tokens":["We","set","off","at","nine."]}]],"sources":[{"id":"cefr","name":"Council of Europe — CEFR daraja tavsiflari","levels":["PRE","A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"skill":"framework","url":"https://www.coe.int/en/web/common-european-framework-reference-languages/level-descriptions","task":"Dars maqsadini qila olaman tavsifi bilan solishtiring. PRE — kursning tayyorlov bosqichi.","lesson":"en-a2-17","verified":"2026-10-05","mode":"link","rights":"Manba saytida bajariladi; himoyalangan matn yoki audio ko‘chirilmagan."},{"id":"pronunciation","name":"Cambridge Dictionary — Pronunciation","levels":["PRE","A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"skill":"pronunciation","url":"https://dictionary.cambridge.org/pronunciation/","task":"Darsdan ikki so‘z tanlang, UK/US talaffuzini eshiting va urg‘uni qayd eting.","lesson":"en-a2-17","verified":"2026-10-05","mode":"link","rights":"Manba saytida bajariladi; himoyalangan matn yoki audio ko‘chirilmagan."},{"id":"bc-grammar","name":"British Council — Grammar","levels":["A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"skill":"grammar","url":"https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/free-resources/grammar","task":"Darajangizdagi dars mavzusini toping va bitta o‘xshash misol yozing.","lesson":"en-a2-17","verified":"2026-10-05","mode":"link","rights":"Manba saytida bajariladi; himoyalangan matn yoki audio ko‘chirilmagan."},{"id":"bc-read","name":"British Council — Reading","levels":["A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"skill":"reading","url":"https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/free-resources/reading","task":"O‘z darajangizdagi matnni tanlang; asosiy fikr va bitta dalilni ajrating.","lesson":"en-a2-17","verified":"2026-10-05","mode":"link","rights":"Manba saytida bajariladi; himoyalangan matn yoki audio ko‘chirilmagan."},{"id":"bc-write","name":"British Council — Writing","levels":["A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"skill":"writing","url":"https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/free-resources/writing","task":"Darajangizdagi namunaning kirish, asosiy qism va yakunini tahlil qiling.","lesson":"en-a2-17","verified":"2026-10-05","mode":"link","rights":"Manba saytida bajariladi; himoyalangan matn yoki audio ko‘chirilmagan."},{"id":"bc-speak","name":"British Council — Speaking (A1–B2)","levels":["A1","A2","B1","B2"],"skill":"speaking","url":"https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/free-resources/speaking","task":"Darajangizdagi video vaziyatidan ikki iborani o‘z dialogingizda ishlating.","lesson":"en-a2-17","verified":"2026-10-05","mode":"link","rights":"Manba saytida bajariladi; himoyalangan matn yoki audio ko‘chirilmagan."},{"id":"bc-listen","name":"British Council — Listening (A1–C1)","levels":["A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"skill":"listening","url":"https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/free-resources/listening","task":"Mos daraja audiosini transkriptsiz tinglang; keyin yozuv bilan tekshiring.","lesson":"en-a2-17","verified":"2026-10-05","mode":"link","rights":"Manba saytida bajariladi; himoyalangan matn yoki audio ko‘chirilmagan."},{"id":"cambridge","name":"Cambridge English — Activities","levels":["A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"skill":"integrated","url":"https://www.cambridgeenglish.org/learning-english/activities-for-learners/","task":"A1–A2, B1–B2 yoki C1–C2 filtrini qo‘llang; dars ko‘nikmasiga mos mashqni tanlang.","lesson":"en-a2-17","verified":"2026-10-05","mode":"link","rights":"Manba saytida bajariladi; himoyalangan matn yoki audio ko‘chirilmagan."}],"recapEvery":4,"project":false,"rights":"Original SinfQuiz content; local Flite synthetic speech. Educational references are linked, not copied."}'::jsonb) on conflict(id,revision) do nothing;
insert into public.sq_en_content(id,base_id,owner_id,level,ordinal,status,revision,payload) values('en-a2-18','en-a2-18',null,2,18,'published',1,'{"id":"en-a2-18","baseId":"en-a2-18","revision":1,"level":"A2","levelIndex":2,"order":18,"title":"Paragraf va sayohat loyihasi","objective":"O‘tgan safar, hozirgi tajriba va keyingi rejani bog‘langan xabarda aytasiz.","context":"Do‘stingizga birinchi mustaqil ekskursiya haqida email yozasiz.","prerequisites":["en-a2-17"],"minutes":40,"skills":["grammar","vocabulary","pronunciation","listening","reading","writing","speaking"],"rules":["Paragrafda bitta asosiy fikr bo‘lsin. First/then/finally vaqt tartibi, because sabab, but farqni bog‘laydi.","O‘tgan aniq voqeada Past Simple, hozirgi tajribada Present Perfect, reja uchun going to ishlatilishini qayta tekshiring.","Emailda salomlashish, asosiy xabar va yakun bo‘lsin. Keraksiz qayta takrorni kamaytiring, lekin muhim joy va vaqtni tushirib qoldirmang."],"pattern":"Greeting → what happened → why it mattered → next plan → closing","examples":["Last Saturday we visited Bukhara.","First, we met our guide.","Then we walked around the old town.","I have never seen that building before.","We are going to return next year.","Please tell me about your trip."],"vocabulary":[{"id":"en-a2-18-v0","term":"guide","meaning":"gid","ipa":"/ɡaɪd/","collocation":"meet a guide","example":"First, we met our guide."},{"id":"en-a2-18-v1","term":"return","meaning":"qaytmoq","ipa":"/rɪˈtɜːn/","collocation":"return next year","example":"We are going to return next year."},{"id":"en-a2-18-v2","term":"trip","meaning":"safar","ipa":"/trɪp/","collocation":"a memorable trip","example":"Please tell me about your trip."},{"id":"en-a2-18-v3","term":"before","meaning":"oldin","ipa":"/bɪˈfɔː/","collocation":"never seen before","example":"I have never seen that building before."}],"visuals":[{"kind":"story","title":"Ma’no va tuzilish","items":["Greeting → what happened → why it mattered → next plan → closing","Last Saturday we visited Bukhara.","First, we met our guide."]},{"kind":"story","title":"Vaziyatni gapga aylantiring","items":["Do‘stingizga birinchi mustaqil ekskursiya haqida email yozasiz.","Then we walked around the old town.","We are going to return next year."]}],"pronunciation":{"focus":"Gapdagi mazmunli so‘zlarni urg‘u bilan ayting. Nuqtada to‘xtab, yozuvni qayta tinglang.","text":"I have never seen that building before.","audio":"/english-course/v7.23/en-a2-18-dictation.mp3"},"exercises":[{"id":"en-a2-18-choice","type":"choice","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Paragraf uchun eng foydali qoida qaysi?","answers":["Keep one main idea and connect details."],"explanation":"Bog‘lanish va bitta asosiy fikr.","hint":"Greeting → what happened → why it mattered → next plan → closing","options":["Keep one main idea and connect details.","Write every sentence without a link.","Repeat one sentence many times."]},{"id":"en-a2-18-gap","type":"grammarFill","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Last Saturday we ___ Bukhara. (visit)","answers":["visited"],"explanation":"Paragrafda bitta asosiy fikr bo‘lsin. First/then/finally vaqt tartibi, because sabab, but farqni bog‘laydi. O‘tgan aniq voqeada Past Simple, hozirgi tajribada Present Perfect, reja uchun going to ishlatilishini qayta tekshiring. Emailda salomlashish, asosiy xabar va yakun bo‘lsin. Keraksiz qayta takrorni kamaytiring, lekin muhim joy va vaqtni tushirib qoldirmang.","hint":"Greeting → what happened → why it mattered → next plan → closing"},{"id":"en-a2-18-order","type":"order","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Kartalarni to‘g‘ri tartibga qo‘ying.","answers":["Last Saturday we visited Bukhara."],"explanation":"Paragrafda bitta asosiy fikr bo‘lsin. First/then/finally vaqt tartibi, because sabab, but farqni bog‘laydi. O‘tgan aniq voqeada Past Simple, hozirgi tajribada Present Perfect, reja uchun going to ishlatilishini qayta tekshiring. Emailda salomlashish, asosiy xabar va yakun bo‘lsin. Keraksiz qayta takrorni kamaytiring, lekin muhim joy va vaqtni tushirib qoldirmang.","hint":"Greeting → what happened → why it mattered → next plan → closing","tokens":["Last","Saturday","we","visited","Bukhara."]},{"id":"en-a2-18-fix","type":"correction","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Yesterday we have visited Bukhara.","answers":["Yesterday we visited Bukhara."],"explanation":"Paragrafda bitta asosiy fikr bo‘lsin. First/then/finally vaqt tartibi, because sabab, but farqni bog‘laydi. O‘tgan aniq voqeada Past Simple, hozirgi tajribada Present Perfect, reja uchun going to ishlatilishini qayta tekshiring. Emailda salomlashish, asosiy xabar va yakun bo‘lsin. Keraksiz qayta takrorni kamaytiring, lekin muhim joy va vaqtni tushirib qoldirmang.","hint":"Greeting → what happened → why it mattered → next plan → closing"},{"id":"en-a2-18-vocabulary","type":"matching","skill":"vocabulary","prompt":"So‘zlarni ma’nolari bilan moslang.","answers":["gid","qaytmoq","safar","oldin"],"explanation":"So‘zni alohida emas, darsdagi birikma va gap bilan eslang.","hint":"Greeting → what happened → why it mattered → next plan → closing","left":["guide","return","trip","before"],"options":["gid","qaytmoq","safar","oldin"]},{"id":"en-a2-18-collocations","type":"collocation","skill":"vocabulary","prompt":"So‘zlarni darsdagi birikmasi bilan moslang.","left":["guide","return","trip","before"],"options":["meet a guide","return next year","a memorable trip","never seen before"],"answers":["meet a guide","return next year","a memorable trip","never seen before"],"hint":"So‘z qaysi birikmada ishlatilishini eslang.","explanation":"Birikmani yozgan gapingizda ham ishlating."}],"reading":{"title":"Paragraf va sayohat loyihasi — vaziyat","text":"Hi Ali, last Saturday our class visited Bukhara. First, we met a guide at the station. Then we walked around the old town and drew one building. I had never noticed how many different patterns a wall could have. At lunch, I lost my bottle, but a classmate found it. I have kept the drawing in my notebook because it reminds me of the day. We are going to return next year and visit the museum too. What did you do last weekend? Best wishes, Lola.","sentences":["Hi Ali, last Saturday our class visited Bukhara.","First, we met a guide at the station.","Then we walked around the old town and drew one building.","I had never noticed how many different patterns a wall could have.","At lunch, I lost my bottle, but a classmate found it.","I have kept the drawing in my notebook because it reminds me of the day.","We are going to return next year and visit the museum too.","What did you do last weekend?","Best wishes, Lola."],"questions":[{"id":"en-a2-18-reading0","type":"choice","skill":"reading","prompt":"Matnning asosiy maqsadi nima?","answers":["sharing a trip and asking about a friend"],"explanation":"Email o‘z safarini aytib do‘stiga savol beradi.","hint":"Greeting → what happened → why it mattered → next plan → closing","options":["sharing a trip and asking about a friend","selling a bottle","giving museum rules"]},{"id":"en-a2-18-reading1","type":"choice","skill":"reading","prompt":"Nima uchun chizmani saqlagan?","answers":["it reminds her of the day"],"explanation":"Because it reminds me of the day.","hint":"Greeting → what happened → why it mattered → next plan → closing","options":["it reminds her of the day","the guide bought it","it is a ticket"]},{"id":"en-a2-18-evidence","type":"evidence","skill":"reading","prompt":"Vaziyatni tanishtiradigan birinchi jumlani tanlang.","answers":["0"],"explanation":"Birinchi jumla matn vaziyatini tanishtiradi; keyingi jumlalar uni rivojlantiradi.","hint":"Greeting → what happened → why it mattered → next plan → closing","options":["Hi Ali, last Saturday our class visited Bukhara.","First, we met a guide at the station.","Then we walked around the old town and drew one building.","I had never noticed how many different patterns a wall could have.","At lunch, I lost my bottle, but a classmate found it.","I have kept the drawing in my notebook because it reminds me of the day.","We are going to return next year and visit the museum too.","What did you do last weekend?","Best wishes, Lola."]}]},"listening":{"title":"Suhbatni tushunish","transcript":"Last Saturday we visited Bukhara. First, we met our guide. Then we walked around the old town. A classmate found my bottle. We are going to return next year and visit the museum.","audio":"/english-course/v7.23/en-a2-18.mp3","synthetic":true,"questions":[{"id":"en-a2-18-listening0","type":"choice","skill":"listening","prompt":"Safar qachon bo‘lgan?","answers":["last Saturday"],"explanation":"Last Saturday — tugallangan vaqt.","hint":"Greeting → what happened → why it mattered → next plan → closing","options":["last Saturday","next year","this morning"]},{"id":"en-a2-18-listening1","type":"choice","skill":"listening","prompt":"Keyingi yil nima qo‘shiladi?","answers":["the museum"],"explanation":"Visit the museum.","hint":"Greeting → what happened → why it mattered → next plan → closing","options":["the museum","a shopping centre","the airport"]},{"id":"en-a2-18-audio-table","type":"table","skill":"listening","prompt":"Tinglangan ma’lumotni jadvalga yozing.","answers":["Bukhara","museum"],"explanation":"Jadvaldagi javoblar yozuvda aynan aytilgan. Mavjud bo‘lmagan tafsilotni taxmin qilmang.","hint":"Greeting → what happened → why it mattered → next plan → closing","rows":["Shahar","Keyingi joy"]},{"id":"en-a2-18-dictation","type":"dictation","skill":"listening","prompt":"Eshitgan gapingizni yozing.","answers":["I have never seen that building before."],"explanation":"Gapdagi asosiy so‘zlar, yordamchi fe’l va inkor saqlanishi kerak.","hint":"Greeting → what happened → why it mattered → next plan → closing","audio":"/english-course/v7.23/en-a2-18-dictation.mp3","transcript":"I have never seen that building before."}]},"writing":{"task":"A2 loyiha: safar yoki o‘tgan voqea haqida do‘stona email yozing; keyingi rejani va bir savolni qo‘shing.","audience":"Sinfdagi sherigingiz","minWords":55,"maxWords":140,"plan":["Vaziyatni ayting.","Darsdagi til vositasidan foydalaning.","Muhim tafsilot yoki sabab qo‘shing.","O‘qib, ma’no va shaklni tekshiring."],"model":"Hi Ali, last Saturday we visited a small village near our town. First, we met our cousins. Then we walked to the river and took photos. I enjoyed the day because the village was quiet. I have kept my favourite photo in my notebook. We are going to visit again in spring. What did you do last weekend? Best wishes, Lola.","modelNotes":["Birinchi gap maqsadni belgilaydi.","Darsdagi tuzilma vaziyatga xizmat qiladi.","Oxirgi gap fikrni yakunlaydi."],"phrases":["Last Saturday we visited Bukhara.","First, we met our guide.","Then we walked around the old town."],"checklist":["Topshiriq va auditoriyaga mos yozdim.","Fikrni o‘z so‘zlarim bilan ifodaladim.","Darsdagi shaklni to‘g‘ri ishlatdim.","Imlo, bog‘lanish va tinish belgilarini tekshirdim."]},"speaking":{"task":"Safar hikoyangizni ayting, keyingi rejangizni tushuntiring va sherigingizga savol bering.","seconds":50,"prompts":["Asosiy fikringiz nima?","Bitta tafsilot yoki misol qo‘shing.","Sherigingizning savoliga javob bering."],"rubric":["Vazifani bajarish","Til vositalari va aniqlik","Bog‘langan, tushunarli nutq","Talaffuz va muloqot"]},"rubrics":{"writing":["Mazmun va vazifani bajarish","Tuzilish va bog‘lanish","Til vositalari va uslub","Grammatika va imlo"],"speaking":["Vazifa va o‘zaro muloqot","Ravonlik va bog‘lanish","Til vositalari va aniqlik","Tushunarlilik va talaffuz"]},"realTask":"Sayr bo‘yicha uch ma’lumotni oling, emailga qo‘shing va sherigingizdan uning rejasini so‘rang.","exit":[[{"id":"en-a2-18-exit0","type":"grammarFill","skill":"grammar","prompt":"First, we ___ our guide. (meet)","answers":["met"],"explanation":"Paragrafda bitta asosiy fikr bo‘lsin. First/then/finally vaqt tartibi, because sabab, but farqni bog‘laydi. O‘tgan aniq voqeada Past Simple, hozirgi tajribada Present Perfect, reja uchun going to ishlatilishini qayta tekshiring. Emailda salomlashish, asosiy xabar va yakun bo‘lsin. Keraksiz qayta takrorni kamaytiring, lekin muhim joy va vaqtni tushirib qoldirmang.","hint":"Greeting → what happened → why it mattered → next plan → closing"},{"id":"en-a2-18-exit1","type":"grammarFill","skill":"grammar","prompt":"We are ___ to return.","answers":["going"],"explanation":"Paragrafda bitta asosiy fikr bo‘lsin. First/then/finally vaqt tartibi, because sabab, but farqni bog‘laydi. O‘tgan aniq voqeada Past Simple, hozirgi tajribada Present Perfect, reja uchun going to ishlatilishini qayta tekshiring. Emailda salomlashish, asosiy xabar va yakun bo‘lsin. Keraksiz qayta takrorni kamaytiring, lekin muhim joy va vaqtni tushirib qoldirmang.","hint":"Greeting → what happened → why it mattered → next plan → closing"},{"id":"en-a2-18-exit2","type":"grammarFill","skill":"grammar","prompt":"I keep it ___ it reminds me of the day.","answers":["because"],"explanation":"Paragrafda bitta asosiy fikr bo‘lsin. First/then/finally vaqt tartibi, because sabab, but farqni bog‘laydi. O‘tgan aniq voqeada Past Simple, hozirgi tajribada Present Perfect, reja uchun going to ishlatilishini qayta tekshiring. Emailda salomlashish, asosiy xabar va yakun bo‘lsin. Keraksiz qayta takrorni kamaytiring, lekin muhim joy va vaqtni tushirib qoldirmang.","hint":"Greeting → what happened → why it mattered → next plan → closing"},{"id":"en-a2-18-exit3","type":"choice","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Aniq o‘tgan vaqtga mos shakl?","answers":["visited last Saturday"],"explanation":"Past Simple.","hint":"Greeting → what happened → why it mattered → next plan → closing","options":["visited last Saturday","have visited last Saturday","will visited last Saturday"]},{"id":"en-a2-18-exit4","type":"choice","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Email yakuniga mos ibora?","answers":["Best wishes"],"explanation":"Best wishes do‘stona yakun.","hint":"Greeting → what happened → why it mattered → next plan → closing","options":["Best wishes","Room 5 only","Did you are"]}],[{"id":"en-a2-18-exit-b0","type":"order","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Gapni tartiblang.","answers":["First, we met our guide."],"explanation":"Paragrafda bitta asosiy fikr bo‘lsin. First/then/finally vaqt tartibi, because sabab, but farqni bog‘laydi. O‘tgan aniq voqeada Past Simple, hozirgi tajribada Present Perfect, reja uchun going to ishlatilishini qayta tekshiring. Emailda salomlashish, asosiy xabar va yakun bo‘lsin. Keraksiz qayta takrorni kamaytiring, lekin muhim joy va vaqtni tushirib qoldirmang.","hint":"Greeting → what happened → why it mattered → next plan → closing","tokens":["First,","we","met","our","guide."]},{"id":"en-a2-18-exit-b1","type":"grammarFill","skill":"grammar","prompt":"We are ___ to return.","answers":["going"],"explanation":"Paragrafda bitta asosiy fikr bo‘lsin. First/then/finally vaqt tartibi, because sabab, but farqni bog‘laydi. O‘tgan aniq voqeada Past Simple, hozirgi tajribada Present Perfect, reja uchun going to ishlatilishini qayta tekshiring. Emailda salomlashish, asosiy xabar va yakun bo‘lsin. Keraksiz qayta takrorni kamaytiring, lekin muhim joy va vaqtni tushirib qoldirmang.","hint":"Greeting → what happened → why it mattered → next plan → closing"},{"id":"en-a2-18-exit-b2","type":"order","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Gapni tartiblang.","answers":["I have never seen that building before."],"explanation":"Paragrafda bitta asosiy fikr bo‘lsin. First/then/finally vaqt tartibi, because sabab, but farqni bog‘laydi. O‘tgan aniq voqeada Past Simple, hozirgi tajribada Present Perfect, reja uchun going to ishlatilishini qayta tekshiring. Emailda salomlashish, asosiy xabar va yakun bo‘lsin. Keraksiz qayta takrorni kamaytiring, lekin muhim joy va vaqtni tushirib qoldirmang.","hint":"Greeting → what happened → why it mattered → next plan → closing","tokens":["I","have","never","seen","that","building","before."]},{"id":"en-a2-18-exit-b3","type":"choice","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Aniq o‘tgan vaqtga mos shakl?","answers":["visited last Saturday"],"explanation":"Past Simple.","hint":"Greeting → what happened → why it mattered → next plan → closing","options":["visited last Saturday","have visited last Saturday","will visited last Saturday"]},{"id":"en-a2-18-exit-b4","type":"order","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Gapni tartiblang.","answers":["Please tell me about your trip."],"explanation":"Paragrafda bitta asosiy fikr bo‘lsin. First/then/finally vaqt tartibi, because sabab, but farqni bog‘laydi. O‘tgan aniq voqeada Past Simple, hozirgi tajribada Present Perfect, reja uchun going to ishlatilishini qayta tekshiring. Emailda salomlashish, asosiy xabar va yakun bo‘lsin. Keraksiz qayta takrorni kamaytiring, lekin muhim joy va vaqtni tushirib qoldirmang.","hint":"Greeting → what happened → why it mattered → next plan → closing","tokens":["Please","tell","me","about","your","trip."]}]],"sources":[{"id":"cefr","name":"Council of Europe — CEFR daraja tavsiflari","levels":["PRE","A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"skill":"framework","url":"https://www.coe.int/en/web/common-european-framework-reference-languages/level-descriptions","task":"Dars maqsadini qila olaman tavsifi bilan solishtiring. PRE — kursning tayyorlov bosqichi.","lesson":"en-a2-18","verified":"2026-10-05","mode":"link","rights":"Manba saytida bajariladi; himoyalangan matn yoki audio ko‘chirilmagan."},{"id":"pronunciation","name":"Cambridge Dictionary — Pronunciation","levels":["PRE","A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"skill":"pronunciation","url":"https://dictionary.cambridge.org/pronunciation/","task":"Darsdan ikki so‘z tanlang, UK/US talaffuzini eshiting va urg‘uni qayd eting.","lesson":"en-a2-18","verified":"2026-10-05","mode":"link","rights":"Manba saytida bajariladi; himoyalangan matn yoki audio ko‘chirilmagan."},{"id":"bc-grammar","name":"British Council — Grammar","levels":["A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"skill":"grammar","url":"https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/free-resources/grammar","task":"Darajangizdagi dars mavzusini toping va bi