A1–A2, B1–B2 yoki C1–C2 filtrini qo‘llang; dars ko‘nikmasiga mos mashqni tanlang.","lesson":"en-a2-18","verified":"2026-10-05","mode":"link","rights":"Manba saytida bajariladi; himoyalangan matn yoki audio ko‘chirilmagan."}],"recapEvery":4,"project":true,"rights":"Original SinfQuiz content; local Flite synthetic speech. Educational references are linked, not copied."}'::jsonb) on conflict(id,revision) do nothing;
insert into public.sq_en_content(id,base_id,owner_id,level,ordinal,status,revision,payload) values('en-b1-01','en-b1-01',null,3,1,'published',1,'{"id":"en-b1-01","baseId":"en-b1-01","revision":1,"level":"B1","levelIndex":3,"order":1,"title":"Zamonni vaziyatga qarab tanlash","objective":"Odat, hozirgi jarayon, o‘tgan voqea va hozirgi natijani bir xabarda ajratasiz.","context":"Ko‘ngilli o‘quvchi maktab kutubxonasidagi ishini tasvirlaydi.","prerequisites":["en-a2-18"],"minutes":40,"skills":["grammar","vocabulary","pronunciation","listening","reading","writing","speaking"],"rules":["Zamonni signal so‘zdan oldin maqsad bilan tanlang: odat — I help; jarayon — I am helping; tugallangan voqea — I helped; hozirgi natija — I have helped.","Bir matnda zamon almashishi xato emas: vaqt va vazifa o‘zgarsa shakl ham o‘zgaradi. Yesterday bilan tugallangan ishni Present Perfectga o‘tkazmang.","Have been to va have gone to farqini, holat fe’llarining odatiy simple shaklini va yordamchi fe’lni qayta tekshiring."],"pattern":"usually help → am helping now → helped yesterday → have finished","examples":["I help in the library every Friday.","Today I am checking the books.","Yesterday we moved two shelves.","We have finished the first shelf.","I know where the books belong.","Lola has gone to the office."],"vocabulary":[{"id":"en-b1-01-v0","term":"volunteer","meaning":"ko‘ngilli","ipa":"/ˌvɒlənˈtɪə/","collocation":"work as a volunteer","example":"A new volunteer is learning the system, and I am showing him one section at a time."},{"id":"en-b1-01-v1","term":"shelf","meaning":"tokcha","ipa":"/ʃelf/","collocation":"move a shelf","example":"We have finished the first shelf."},{"id":"en-b1-01-v2","term":"belong","meaning":"tegishli bo‘lmoq","ipa":"/bɪˈlɒŋ/","collocation":"belong on a shelf","example":"I know where the books belong."},{"id":"en-b1-01-v3","term":"check","meaning":"tekshirmoq","ipa":"/tʃek/","collocation":"check a list","example":"Today I am checking the books."}],"visuals":[{"kind":"timeline","title":"Ma’no va tuzilish","items":["usually help → am helping now → helped yesterday → have finished","I help in the library every Friday.","Today I am checking the books."],"timeline":[{"why":"Every Friday muntazam odat. Present Simple bitta ayni damdagi voqea bilan cheklanmaydi.","events":[{"kind":"repeat","from":70,"to":570,"label":"Juma kunlarida takrorlanadi"}]},{"why":"Today I am checking vaqtinchalik bugungi jarayonni ajratadi.","events":[{"kind":"span","from":260,"to":380,"label":"Bugungi tekshirish jarayoni"}]}]},{"kind":"story","title":"Vaziyatni gapga aylantiring","items":["Ko‘ngilli o‘quvchi maktab kutubxonasidagi ishini tasvirlaydi.","Yesterday we moved two shelves.","I know where the books belong."]}],"pronunciation":{"focus":"Gapdagi mazmunli so‘zlarni urg‘u bilan ayting. Nuqtada to‘xtab, yozuvni qayta tinglang.","text":"We have finished the first shelf.","audio":"/english-course/v7.23/en-b1-01-dictation.mp3"},"exercises":[{"id":"en-b1-01-choice","type":"choice","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Hozirgi natijaga mos gap?","answers":["We have finished the first shelf."],"explanation":"Natija hozirgi ishga bog‘liq.","hint":"usually help → am helping now → helped yesterday → have finished","options":["We have finished the first shelf.","We have finish yesterday.","We were finish every Friday."]},{"id":"en-b1-01-gap","type":"grammarFill","skill":"grammar","prompt":"We ___ two shelves yesterday. (move)","answers":["moved"],"explanation":"Zamonni signal so‘zdan oldin maqsad bilan tanlang: odat — I help; jarayon — I am helping; tugallangan voqea — I helped; hozirgi natija — I have helped. Bir matnda zamon almashishi xato emas: vaqt va vazifa o‘zgarsa shakl ham o‘zgaradi. Yesterday bilan tugallangan ishni Present Perfectga o‘tkazmang. Have been to va have gone to farqini, holat fe’llarining odatiy simple shaklini va yordamchi fe’lni qayta tekshiring.","hint":"usually help → am helping now → helped yesterday → have finished"},{"id":"en-b1-01-order","type":"order","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Kartalarni to‘g‘ri tartibga qo‘ying.","answers":["I help in the library every Friday."],"explanation":"Zamonni signal so‘zdan oldin maqsad bilan tanlang: odat — I help; jarayon — I am helping; tugallangan voqea — I helped; hozirgi natija — I have helped. Bir matnda zamon almashishi xato emas: vaqt va vazifa o‘zgarsa shakl ham o‘zgaradi. Yesterday bilan tugallangan ishni Present Perfectga o‘tkazmang. Have been to va have gone to farqini, holat fe’llarining odatiy simple shaklini va yordamchi fe’lni qayta tekshiring.","hint":"usually help → am helping now → helped yesterday → have finished","tokens":["I","help","in","the","library","every","Friday."]},{"id":"en-b1-01-fix","type":"correction","skill":"grammar","prompt":"We have finished it yesterday.","answers":["We finished it yesterday."],"explanation":"Zamonni signal so‘zdan oldin maqsad bilan tanlang: odat — I help; jarayon — I am helping; tugallangan voqea — I helped; hozirgi natija — I have helped. Bir matnda zamon almashishi xato emas: vaqt va vazifa o‘zgarsa shakl ham o‘zgaradi. Yesterday bilan tugallangan ishni Present Perfectga o‘tkazmang. Have been to va have gone to farqini, holat fe’llarining odatiy simple shaklini va yordamchi fe’lni qayta tekshiring.","hint":"usually help → am helping now → helped yesterday → have finished"},{"id":"en-b1-01-vocabulary","type":"matching","skill":"vocabulary","prompt":"So‘zlarni ma’nolari bilan moslang.","answers":["ko‘ngilli","tokcha","tegishli bo‘lmoq","tekshirmoq"],"explanation":"So‘zni alohida emas, darsdagi birikma va gap bilan eslang.","hint":"usually help → am helping now → helped yesterday → have finished","left":["volunteer","shelf","belong","check"],"options":["ko‘ngilli","tokcha","tegishli bo‘lmoq","tekshirmoq"]}],"reading":{"title":"Zamonni vaziyatga qarab tanlash — vaziyat","text":"I help in our school library every Friday. Usually, I return books to their shelves and help younger students find stories. This week we are changing the room, so today I am checking the labels instead. Yesterday we moved two shelves away from the window. We have finished the first shelf, but the second one still needs labels. Lola has gone to the office to print them. She will return soon. I know where most books belong because I have worked here for a year. A new volunteer is learning the system, and I am showing him one section at a time. He made two mistakes yesterday, but he understands the categories better now. Our teacher says that finishing quickly is less important than putting each book in a place readers can find. We are keeping a short record so that next week’s volunteers can continue our work.","sentences":["I help in our school library every Friday.","Usually, I return books to their shelves and help younger students find stories.","This week we are changing the room, so today I am checking the labels instead.","Yesterday we moved two shelves away from the window.","We have finished the first shelf, but the second one still needs labels.","Lola has gone to the office to print them.","She will return soon.","I know where most books belong because I have worked here for a year.","A new volunteer is learning the system, and I am showing him one section at a time.","He made two mistakes yesterday, but he understands the categories better now.","Our teacher says that finishing quickly is less important than putting each book in a place readers can find.","We are keeping a short record so that next week’s volunteers can continue our work."],"questions":[{"id":"en-b1-01-reading0","type":"choice","skill":"reading","prompt":"Bugun nega odatdagi ishini qilmayapti?","answers":["the room is being changed"],"explanation":"This week roomni o‘zgartirishmoqda; bugungi vazifa boshqa.","hint":"usually help → am helping now → helped yesterday → have finished","options":["the room is being changed","the library has closed forever","he dislikes younger students"]},{"id":"en-b1-01-reading1","type":"choice","skill":"reading","prompt":"Nima tezlikdan muhimroq deb aytiladi?","answers":["putting books where readers can find them"],"explanation":"Ustoz ish maqsadini aniqlik bilan bog‘laydi.","hint":"usually help → am helping now → helped yesterday → have finished","options":["putting books where readers can find them","printing more labels than needed","avoiding records"]},{"id":"en-b1-01-evidence","type":"evidence","skill":"reading","prompt":"Vaziyatni tanishtiradigan birinchi jumlani tanlang.","answers":["0"],"explanation":"Birinchi jumla matn vaziyatini tanishtiradi; keyingi jumlalar uni rivojlantiradi.","hint":"usually help → am helping now → helped yesterday → have finished","options":["I help in our school library every Friday.","Usually, I return books to their shelves and help younger students find stories.","This week we are changing the room, so today I am checking the labels instead.","Yesterday we moved two shelves away from the window.","We have finished the first shelf, but the second one still needs labels.","Lola has gone to the office to print them.","She will return soon.","I know where most books belong because I have worked here for a year.","A new volunteer is learning the system, and I am showing him one section at a time.","He made two mistakes yesterday, but he understands the categories better now.","Our teacher says that finishing quickly is less important than putting each book in a place readers can find.","We are keeping a short record so that next week’s volunteers can continue our work."]}]},"listening":{"title":"Suhbatni tushunish","transcript":"I usually help in the library on Fridays. Today I am checking labels because we are changing the room. We moved two shelves yesterday. We have finished one shelf. Lola has gone to the office to print the remaining labels, and she will return soon.","audio":"/english-course/v7.23/en-b1-01.mp3","synthetic":true,"questions":[{"id":"en-b1-01-listening0","type":"choice","skill":"listening","prompt":"Lola qaytganmi?","answers":["not yet"],"explanation":"Has gone va will return hali qaytmaganini ko‘rsatadi.","hint":"usually help → am helping now → helped yesterday → have finished","options":["not yet","she returned yesterday","she has never left"]},{"id":"en-b1-01-listening1","type":"choice","skill":"listening","prompt":"Nechta tokcha tugadi?","answers":["one"],"explanation":"Finished one shelf.","hint":"usually help → am helping now → helped yesterday → have finished","options":["one","two","none"]},{"id":"en-b1-01-audio-table","type":"table","skill":"listening","prompt":"Tinglangan ma’lumotni jadvalga yozing.","answers":["Fridays","checking labels"],"explanation":"Jadvaldagi javoblar yozuvda aynan aytilgan. Mavjud bo‘lmagan tafsilotni taxmin qilmang.","hint":"usually help → am helping now → helped yesterday → have finished","rows":["Odatdagi kun","Bugungi vazifa"]},{"id":"en-b1-01-dictation","type":"dictation","skill":"listening","prompt":"Eshitgan gapingizni yozing.","answers":["We have finished the first shelf."],"explanation":"Gapdagi asosiy so‘zlar, yordamchi fe’l va inkor saqlanishi kerak.","hint":"usually help → am helping now → helped yesterday → have finished","audio":"/english-course/v7.23/en-b1-01-dictation.mp3","transcript":"We have finished the first shelf."}]},"writing":{"task":"Doimiy vazifangiz, bugungi ishingiz, kechagi o‘zgarish va hozirgi natijani bitta xabarda tushuntiring.","audience":"Sinfdagi sherigingiz","minWords":90,"maxWords":220,"plan":["Vaziyatni ayting.","Darsdagi til vositasidan foydalaning.","Muhim tafsilot yoki sabab qo‘shing.","O‘qib, ma’no va shaklni tekshiring."],"model":"I usually help in the school library on Fridays. I put returned books on the shelves and show younger students where to look. Today I am checking labels because we are changing the room. Yesterday we moved two shelves to make more space near the window. We have finished one section, but we still need labels for the other. My friend has gone to the office to print them. I know most categories now, although I made mistakes when I first started. We are keeping a short record so that the next group can continue the work without confusion.","modelNotes":["Birinchi gap maqsadni belgilaydi.","Darsdagi tuzilma vaziyatga xizmat qiladi.","Oxirgi gap fikrni yakunlaydi."],"phrases":["I help in the library every Friday.","Today I am checking the books.","Yesterday we moved two shelves."],"checklist":["Topshiriq va auditoriyaga mos yozdim.","Fikrni o‘z so‘zlarim bilan ifodaladim.","Darsdagi shaklni to‘g‘ri ishlatdim.","Imlo, bog‘lanish va tinish belgilarini tekshirdim."]},"speaking":{"task":"Bir faoliyatingizni to‘rt vaqt nuqtasidan tasvirlang va sherigingizning aniqlashtiruvchi savoliga javob bering.","seconds":75,"prompts":["Asosiy fikringiz nima?","Bitta tafsilot yoki misol qo‘shing.","Sherigingizning savoliga javob bering."],"rubric":["Vazifani bajarish","Til vositalari va aniqlik","Bog‘langan, tushunarli nutq","Talaffuz va muloqot"]},"rubrics":{"writing":["Mazmun va vazifani bajarish","Tuzilish va bog‘lanish","Til vositalari va uslub","Grammatika va imlo"],"speaking":["Vazifa va o‘zaro muloqot","Ravonlik va bog‘lanish","Til vositalari va aniqlik","Tushunarlilik va talaffuz"]},"realTask":"Doimiy vazifangiz, bugungi ishingiz, kechagi o‘zgarish va hozirgi natijani bitta xabarda tushuntiring.","exit":[[{"id":"en-b1-01-exit0","type":"grammarFill","skill":"grammar","prompt":"I ___ in the library every Friday. (help)","answers":["help"],"explanation":"Zamonni signal so‘zdan oldin maqsad bilan tanlang: odat — I help; jarayon — I am helping; tugallangan voqea — I helped; hozirgi natija — I have helped. Bir matnda zamon almashishi xato emas: vaqt va vazifa o‘zgarsa shakl ham o‘zgaradi. Yesterday bilan tugallangan ishni Present Perfectga o‘tkazmang. Have been to va have gone to farqini, holat fe’llarining odatiy simple shaklini va yordamchi fe’lni qayta tekshiring.","hint":"usually help → am helping now → helped yesterday → have finished"},{"