grammar","prompt":"Gapni tartiblang.","answers":["Today I am checking the books."],"explanation":"Zamonni signal so‘zdan oldin maqsad bilan tanlang: odat — I help; jarayon — I am helping; tugallangan voqea — I helped; hozirgi natija — I have helped. Bir matnda zamon almashishi xato emas: vaqt va vazifa o‘zgarsa shakl ham o‘zgaradi. Yesterday bilan tugallangan ishni Present Perfectga o‘tkazmang. Have been to va have gone to farqini, holat fe’llarining odatiy simple shaklini va yordamchi fe’lni qayta tekshiring.","hint":"usually help → am helping now → helped yesterday → have finished","tokens":["Today","I","am","checking","the","books."]},{"id":"en-b1-01-exit-b1","type":"grammarFill","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Today I am ___ labels. (check)","answers":["checking"],"explanation":"Zamonni signal so‘zdan oldin maqsad bilan tanlang: odat — I help; jarayon — I am helping; tugallangan voqea — I helped; hozirgi natija — I have helped. Bir matnda zamon almashishi xato emas: vaqt va vazifa o‘zgarsa shakl ham o‘zgaradi. Yesterday bilan tugallangan ishni Present Perfectga o‘tkazmang. Have been to va have gone to farqini, holat fe’llarining odatiy simple shaklini va yordamchi fe’lni qayta tekshiring.","hint":"usually help → am helping now → helped yesterday → have finished"},{"id":"en-b1-01-exit-b2","type":"order","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Gapni tartiblang.","answers":["We have finished the first shelf."],"explanation":"Zamonni signal so‘zdan oldin maqsad bilan tanlang: odat — I help; jarayon — I am helping; tugallangan voqea — I helped; hozirgi natija — I have helped. Bir matnda zamon almashishi xato emas: vaqt va vazifa o‘zgarsa shakl ham o‘zgaradi. Yesterday bilan tugallangan ishni Present Perfectga o‘tkazmang. Have been to va have gone to farqini, holat fe’llarining odatiy simple shaklini va yordamchi fe’lni qayta tekshiring.","hint":"usually help → am helping now → helped yesterday → have finished","tokens":["We","have","finished","the","first","shelf."]},{"id":"en-b1-01-exit-b3","type":"choice","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Lola has gone to the office. U qayerda bo‘lishi mumkin?","answers":["away at the office"],"explanation":"Gone hozir ketganligini bildiradi.","hint":"usually help → am helping now → helped yesterday → have finished","options":["away at the office","back here already","never at the office"]},{"id":"en-b1-01-exit-b4","type":"order","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Gapni tartiblang.","answers":["Lola has gone to the office."],"explanation":"Zamonni signal so‘zdan oldin maqsad bilan tanlang: odat — I help; jarayon — I am helping; tugallangan voqea — I helped; hozirgi natija — I have helped. Bir matnda zamon almashishi xato emas: vaqt va vazifa o‘zgarsa shakl ham o‘zgaradi. Yesterday bilan tugallangan ishni Present Perfectga o‘tkazmang. Have been to va have gone to farqini, holat fe’llarining odatiy simple shaklini va yordamchi fe’lni qayta tekshiring.","hint":"usually help → am helping now → helped yesterday → have finished","tokens":["Lola","has","gone","to","the","office."]}]],"sources":[{"id":"cefr","name":"Council of Europe — CEFR daraja tavsiflari","levels":["PRE","A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"skill":"framework","url":"https://www.coe.int/en/web/common-european-framework-reference-languages/level-descriptions","task":"Dars maqsadini qila olaman tavsifi bilan solishtiring. PRE — kursning tayyorlov bosqichi.","lesson":"en-b1-01","verified":"2026-10-05","mode":"link","rights":"Manba saytida bajariladi; himoyalangan matn yoki audio ko‘chirilmagan."},{"id":"pronunciation","name":"Cambridge Dictionary — Pronunciation","levels":["PRE","A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"skill":"pronunciation","url":"https://dictionary.cambridge.org/pronunciation/","task":"Darsdan ikki so‘z tanlang, UK/US talaffuzini eshiting va urg‘uni qayd eting.","lesson":"en-b1-01","verified":"2026-10-05","mode":"link","rights":"Manba saytida bajariladi; himoyalangan matn yoki audio ko‘chirilmagan."},{"id":"bc-grammar","name":"British Council — Grammar","levels":["A1